#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/010_a_bigger_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You brought the ale to my wedding, and now I can help you! Bring me two pots of tar from Helga in "
"Ekvik, and I will make your hold wider: room for one more crate."
msgstr ""
"{crew|你|你|你们}把麦酒送到了我的婚礼，现在轮到我帮{crew|你|你|你们}了！从埃克维克的赫尔加那里给我带两罐焦油，我就把{crew|你|你|你们}的货舱加宽：多装一箱货。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/010_a_bigger_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Pine tar, boiled from the roots in the forest. It smells strong, but it keeps the water out!"
msgstr "松焦油，是用林子里的树根熬出来的。味道很冲，可是能挡住水！"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/010_a_bigger_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Good tar! A plank here, a rib there... Done: your hold takes one more crate now."
msgstr "好焦油！这里加块木板，那里加根肋骨……好了：{crew|你|你|你们}的货舱现在能多装一箱了。"

