"sacks of charcoal from Grim to fire it."
msgstr "我的窑被冻裂了！要盖一个新的，我需要埃克维克的六篮黏土，还有格里姆的三袋木炭来烧窑。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/062_the_cracked_kiln/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Clay again? Dagny must be building a castle!"
