#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/069_fish_for_the_hunters/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fish for the Hunters"
msgstr "给猎人的鱼"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/069_fish_for_the_hunters/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My hunters go north for the whole summer. They need dried fish: six crates. Bring them within "
"three days, before they leave."
msgstr "我的猎人们要去北方过一整个夏天。他们需要鱼干：六箱。在他们出发前，三天之内送来。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/069_fish_for_the_hunters/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Six crates! The hunters say: this fish tastes better than the bear meat. Ha! Here is your silver."
msgstr "六箱！猎人们说：这鱼比熊肉还好吃。哈！这是{crew|你|你|你们}的银币。"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/069_fish_for_the_hunters/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Dried fish kept for years, and was the bread of the travellers."
msgstr "鱼干能放好几年，是旅人的干粮。"

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/070_the_boat_procession/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Boat Procession"
msgstr "船队游行"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/070_the_boat_procession/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Midsummer again! This year, all the boats row in a line with torches. Bring three crates of mead, "
"and four torches from Orm in Hallvik: your boat leads the line!"
msgstr "又到仲夏了！今年，所有的船都举着火把排成一队划。带三箱蜂蜜酒来，再去哈尔维克的奥尔姆那里拿四支火把：{crew|你|你|你们}的船打头！"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/070_the_boat_procession/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Mead for after the procession. Now the torches."
msgstr "游行完了喝的蜂蜜酒。现在还差火把。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/070_the_boat_procession/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My best tar torches, from the ones you helped me make!"
msgstr "我最好的焦油火把，就是{crew|你|你|你们}帮我做的那些！"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/070_the_boat_procession/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Twenty boats in a line, and you in front, with the dragon head! The torches shine on the water. "
"The most beautiful night of the year."
msgstr "二十条船排成一队，{crew|你|你|你们}在最前面，船头是龙头！火把照在水面上。一年里最美的夜晚。"

