#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/074_a_striped_sail/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your boat has a dragon head, but no sail. I will weave you a little one, with red and white "
"stripes. Bring me six crates of wool, and give me two nights."
msgstr "{crew|你|你|你们}的船有龙头，可是没有帆。我给{crew|你|你|你们}织一面小帆，红白条纹的。给我带六箱羊毛来，再给我两个晚上。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/074_a_striped_sail/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Now the looms clatter. Come back in two days!"
msgstr "织布机咔嗒咔嗒响起来了。两天后再来吧！"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/074_a_striped_sail/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Red and white stripes, like the great ships! It is small, but on a windy day it helps your arms."
msgstr "红白条纹，就像那些大船一样！它不大，可是有风的日子，它能帮{crew|你|你|你们}省些力气。"

