#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/077_ale_for_two_inns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ale for Two Inns"
msgstr "两家旅店的麦酒"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/077_ale_for_two_inns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Both inns ran dry at the same time! Six barrels for Gudrun in Vargvik and six for Orm in Hallvik. "
"With twelve crates of room, you can do it in one trip!"
msgstr "两家旅店的酒同时喝光了！六桶给瓦格维克的古德伦，六桶给哈尔维克的奥尔姆。{crew|你|你|你们}的船能装十二箱，一趟就能运完！"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/077_ale_for_two_inns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ale! The guests cheer. Thank you!"
msgstr "麦酒！客人们欢呼起来。谢谢{crew|你|你|你们}！"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/077_ale_for_two_inns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "At last! I thought I must serve water. Here, silver for you and for Knut."
msgstr "总算来了！我还以为只能给客人倒水了。来，给{crew|你|你|你们}和克努特的银币。"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/077_ale_for_two_inns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Everybody drank weak ale every day: it was safer than water from the lake."
msgstr "那时人人每天都喝淡麦酒：它比湖里的水更安全。"

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/078_the_sleepy_hens/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Sleepy Hens"
msgstr "犯困的母鸡"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/078_the_sleepy_hens/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Our hens sit sleepy in the corner and lay no eggs. You are healers now: what do they need? Ask "
"Tova, and bring it."
msgstr "我们的母鸡困困地坐在角落里，不下蛋了。{crew|你|你|你们}现在是草药师了：它们需要什么？去问问托娃，带回来。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/078_the_sleepy_hens/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Sleepy hens? Lice, I bet. Dust baths with wood ash and a bit of garlic in the water. Here, take "
"garlic."
msgstr "犯困的母鸡？我猜是长虱子了。让它们在木灰里洗个灰土澡，再在水里放点大蒜。来，拿些大蒜去。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/078_the_sleepy_hens/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Garlic water, ash baths, fresh grain... Cluck! An egg! You are real healers."
msgstr "大蒜水、灰浴、新鲜的粮食……咯咯！下蛋了！{crew|你|你|你们}是真正的草药师了。"

