#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/082_the_colt_in_the_mud/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A horse stuck in mud must be pulled out slowly, or it hurts its legs."
msgstr "陷在泥里的马要慢慢拉出来，不然会伤到腿。"

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/083_grain_for_the_north/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Grain for the North"
msgstr "给北方的粮食"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/083_grain_for_the_north/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My hunters send news: the summer in the north was cold, and their families have no grain. My ship "
"leaves in three days: fill it with twelve crates!"
msgstr "我的猎人们捎来消息：北方的夏天很冷，他们的家人没有粮食了。我的船三天后出发：给它装满十二箱！"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/083_grain_for_the_north/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Twelve crates! Nobody in the north goes hungry this winter. The whole valley thanks you."
msgstr "十二箱！今年冬天北方没有人会挨饿了。整个山谷都谢谢{crew|你|你|你们}。"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/083_grain_for_the_north/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "When the harvest failed, the farms helped each other: next year, it might be them."
msgstr "收成不好的时候，农庄会互相帮忙：明年说不定就轮到自己了。"

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/084_the_wool_fair/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Wool Fair"
msgstr "羊毛集市"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/084_the_wool_fair/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The wool fair! Traders come from the Long Lake to buy. Bring me eight crates of wool, the more the"
" better, and the fair is a success."
msgstr "羊毛集市！商人们从长湖赶来买羊毛。给我带八箱羊毛，越多越好，集市就能办成功。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/084_the_wool_fair/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Eight crates! The traders from the Long Lake ask: who are these girls? I say: the best traders of "
"the Home Lakes."
msgstr "八箱！长湖来的商人问：{crew|这个孩子是谁|这个姑娘是谁|这些孩子是谁|这些姑娘是谁}？我说：家乡湖区最好的商人。"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/084_the_wool_fair/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Wool was so important that some sagas tell of whole ships full of it."
msgstr "羊毛非常重要，有些传说里讲到过装满羊毛的整条船。"

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Goats on the Island"
msgstr "岛上的山羊"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My four goats swam to Bergö! They eat Dagny's flowers, and she is cross. Bring them back before "
"they eat her kiln too!"
msgstr "我的四只山羊游到贝里岛去了！它们吃了达格妮的花，她很生气。在它们把她的窑也吃掉之前，把它们带回来！"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My naughty goats! Tomorrow I build a higher fence. Here, my best cheese."
msgstr "我淘气的山羊！明天我就搭一道更高的篱笆。来，我最好的奶酪。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Take them, take them! They ate my flowers and a basket and a shoe!"
msgstr "带走，带走！它们吃了我的花，还有一个篮子和一只鞋！"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Goats are good swimmers when they must be, and they eat nearly anything."
msgstr "山羊需要的时候很会游泳，而且几乎什么都吃。"

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "News for Everybody"
msgstr "告诉大家的消息"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Big news: a ship from the Long Lake will come, and the way between the lakes opens! Tell the "
"smith, the fishers of Stormvik and Orm in Hallvik. I tell the rest."
msgstr "大消息：一艘长湖来的船要来了，湖与湖之间的路要通了！去告诉铁匠、斯托姆维克的渔民和哈尔维克的奥尔姆。别的人我来告诉。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A ship from the Long Lake? They will want my iron!"
msgstr "长湖来的船？他们会想要我的铁器！"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "New lakes, new fish! Thank you for telling us."
msgstr "新的湖，新的鱼！谢谢{crew|你|你|你们}来告诉我们。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Guests from far away! I must brew more. Thank you, girls!"
