#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"So many guests! Bring four crates of mead, four of ale and four of cheese. Twelve crates: your big"
" boat can do it, but you must buy well."
msgstr "客人好多呀！带四箱蜂蜜酒、四箱麦酒和四箱奶酪来。十二箱：{crew|你|你|你们}的大船装得下，可是要会买才行。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Mead! Now the ale."
msgstr "蜂蜜酒！现在还差麦酒。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ale! Now the cheese."
msgstr "麦酒！现在还差奶酪。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Everything is ready: the tables, the torches, the food. Now only the guests!"
msgstr "一切都准备好了：桌子、火把、食物。现在只差客人了！"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "At a feast, the host gave the best food and drink: being generous brought honour."
msgstr "宴会上，主人拿出最好的吃的喝的：大方会带来荣誉。"

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
